{"t":"Ishebad","s":"ishebad-1fa7a","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Ishebad</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAnkrahmun\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145837&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33158,32848,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33158, 32848, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Representative</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.3<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 11, 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230826103608&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ishebad_ff0cb4.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Ishebad.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Arkhothep\">Arkhothep</a>'s Palace above <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Library%20Tomb\">Ankrahmun Library Tomb</a>, ground floor.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Ishebad is the Grand Vizier to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Arkhothep\">Pharaoh</a>. He is responsible for the daily affairs of the city of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, and can promote characters.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not buy anything.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not sell anything.</p></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Ishebad.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: Be mourned, pilgrim in flesh. Are you looking for a promotion?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>promotion</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: Do you want to be promoted in your vocation for 20000 gold?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>no</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: Ok, then not.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: You are already promoted.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: I am Ishebad the chosen.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job or arkhothep</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: The pharaoh wants not to be disturbed. I am his grand vizier and responsible for the daily affairs of the city and promotions of heroes.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: Time does not matter to the undead.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>undead</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: Undeath is only for the choosen.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>ankrahmun</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: Our city will become the capital of a worldwide empire.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>tibia</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: This world just awaits the wisdom of our pharaoh. It needs that wisdom and will soon learn to appreciate it.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>carlin or venore or kazordoon or ab'dendriel</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: Other cities are of no importance. Ankrahmun will become the center of the known world anyways.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>darashia</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: This village is so insignificant that our wise pharaoh has choosen to ignore it.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>darama</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: The rule of our beloved pharaoh will soon spread this continent and one day the whole known world.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>scarab</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: The scarabs are keepers of secrets. Some secrets are not meant for you mortals. Ever keep that in mind.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>pharaoh</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: Our immortal ruler, may he be blessed, is the keeper of our enlightenment and our saviour.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>akh or rah or uthun or ascension</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: Consult a priest to learn how you could achieve ascension.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong>: Good bye, <i>player</i>!<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ishebad</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":33158,"y":32848,"z":7}}